---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
export const prerender = false;
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Notice | GoldShore" description="How GoldShore handles information submitted through its websites and services." canonicalPath="/legal/privacy/">
  <section class="gs-section gs-section--padded">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Effective August 22, 2026.</strong> This notice describes information handled through GoldShore websites, contact forms, project intake, newsletters, and protected services.</p>
    <h2>Information we receive</h2>
    <p>We receive information you choose to submit, such as your name, business email, organization, project details, and messages. Our systems may also process basic security and diagnostic data, including IP address, request time, browser information, and service logs.</p>
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>We use this information to respond to requests, provide and secure services, troubleshoot failures, measure site performance, and meet legal obligations. We do not describe a form submission as consent to unrelated marketing.</p>
    <h2>Service providers and disclosure</h2>
    <p>Infrastructure, security, communications, and analytics providers may process limited information on our behalf. Sponsored or affiliate editorial content is labeled where it appears. We do not present the sale of personal information as part of our business model.</p>
    <h2>Retention and choices</h2>
    <p>We retain information for as long as needed for the purpose it was collected, security, recordkeeping, or legal requirements. You may ask about, correct, or request deletion of information you submitted, subject to applicable exceptions.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Send privacy questions through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> and select the closest available subject. Do not include passwords, API keys, financial account credentials, or other secrets.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
